               <div class="sr-only">Video description: The first frame shows the MC Raptor mascot posing on campus in
                  front of a Montgomery College sign. The second frame shows a group of volleyball players
                  cheering. The third frame shows a group of engineering students working on a project
                  in a lab. The fourth frame shows a group of students talking on the steps of a campus
                  building. The fifth frame shows a student conducting a science experiment using liquids
                  and graduated cylinders in a lab. The sixth frame shows students throwing colored
                  powder into the air in celebration. The seventh and final frame shows a group of dancers
